<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Lonrho Sugar issues further cautionary.</title>
<headline>Lonrho Sugar issues further cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lonrho Sugar Corp Ltd, listed in South Africa and Swaziland, on Monday issued a further cautionary announcement to shareholders regarding unspecified talks.</p>
<p>The company first announced it was in talks in January, sparking speculation that the company, controlled by Britain's Lonrho Plc, might be bought up by another sugar concern.</p>
<p>Lonrho Sugar has plantation investments in Mauritius, South Africa, Swaziland and Malawi.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
